Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid adalah Roy Alphard?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.83,0:00:05.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Beatrice juga mengatakannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.20,0:00:09.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uskup Agung sang Rakus\Nyang bertarung di Kota Gerbang Air
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.23,0:00:10.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa mengubah wujudnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.85,0:00:13.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bukan hanya jiwanya,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,kekuatannya yang gila juga\Nbisa mereplikasi tubuh fisiknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.79,0:00:22.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan salah paham dulu kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.70,0:00:26.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah jelas kalau aku, ya aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.55,0:00:27.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang di depan kita,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.47,0:00:31.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,tubuhnya memang milik Roy Alphard.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.89,0:00:34.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, jiwanya berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.68,0:00:38.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingatan Reid Astrea\Ntelah dimakan oleh Roy Alphard.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.88,0:00:41.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, ia menimpa jiwa lawannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mengambil alih tubuh fisiknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.60,0:00:47.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu dia bisa turun ke sini\Ndari lantai dua tanpa batasan apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.80,0:00:52.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin aku dimakan habis\Noleh bocah rakus itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah kau merasa sangat yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahwa kau bisa mengambil kesadarannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.33,0:00:59.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak punya alasan pintar seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.87,0:01:02.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keyakinanku hanyalah satu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahwa aku adalah aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.18,0:01:08.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eng, boleh tanya sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.95,0:01:12.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku turut senang kamu bisa hidup kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.45,0:01:15.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku punya urusan penting\Ndengan orang yang kamu makan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu situasimu, wajah bening.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.50,0:01:23.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah tengil ini anehnya tahu banyak hal.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.05,0:01:26.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bisa melihat ingatan Roy Alphard?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.30,0:01:29.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, hei, jangan melawak, dong!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.95,0:01:32.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak punya kewajiban untuk membantumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.45,0:01:36.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, kalian tak ada yang bisa lolos\Ndari ujianku selain wajah bening ini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.95,0:01:39.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di situasi begini\Nkau masih memedulikan ujian?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang aku pedulikan bukan ujiannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,melainkan prinsip.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.35,0:01:48.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.65,0:01:50.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tak setuju\Nberarti tak ada pilihan lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.83,0:01:57.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.65,0:01:58.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita lakukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.15,0:02:12.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh memalukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Trikmu memang sia-sia.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.11,0:02:17.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi masih mending daripada diam saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.41,0:02:23.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, ini bukan masalah jumlah kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau juga berpikir begitu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau sangat terobsesi padaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah? Kau melawak?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.33,0:02:36.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru kau yang terlalu terobsesi padaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.23,0:02:39.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga sama saja, ikan teri.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cara kau mengayunkan pedang saja\Nmasih berantakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi tidak ada serunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.15,0:02:47.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak menggunakan pedang...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak membicarakan soal itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang merepotkan datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih belum, Beatrice.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti akan ada cara\Nuntuk membalikkan situasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, bukan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.25,0:03:06.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia datang!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.68,0:03:07.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Datang?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah bilang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.67,0:03:13.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang merepotkan datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.80,0:03:16.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.06,0:03:22.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murak.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apanya yang tidak mungkin?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Matamu terbuka, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.89,0:04:07.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apanya yang tidak mungkin dariku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma itu yang bisa kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.73,0:04:14.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, kau pasti akan kami kalahkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salah satu dari kami akan mengalahkanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.86,0:04:21.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya bersikaplah keren\Nsampai akhir dengan namamu sendiri,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.41,0:04:22.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,ikan teri.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.45,0:04:30.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.65,0:04:38.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bisa memanggil nama Beti,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.10,0:04:41.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,berarti kau tidak kehilangan ingatanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.25,0:04:47.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru bangun?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echidna! Semuanya aman?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.45,0:05:12.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, sebelah sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.28,0:05:15.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kau sudah bangun, Subaru?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.80,0:05:17.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengarkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.15,0:05:38.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai aku bukan diriku yang seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.43,0:05:41.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melainkan diriku yang lebih kuat, pintar,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.85,0:05:44.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan lebih tangguh dari ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.95,0:06:01.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.84,0:06:09.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kayaknya yang lain sedang terlibat\Nmasalah yang merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.93,0:06:12.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ada yang bisa kulakukan untuk Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.80,0:06:16.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang bisa dilakukan untuk diriku, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.60,0:06:17.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.65,0:06:20.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Master yang minta,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,mau menerobos api atau air,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.25,0:06:26.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,bahkan air terjun raksasa pun\Nakan kulewati dengan Fly Away!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.62,0:06:30.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kau akan melakukan\Napa pun yang kuminta?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.70,0:06:34.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Master yang minta,\Napa pun akan kulakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.85,0:06:35.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.83,0:06:40.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku menyuruhmu mati, apa kau mau mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.78,0:06:42.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.35,0:06:46.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master mau aku mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.33,0:06:51.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Master yang minta sih, aku mau saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.06,0:06:52.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, situasi di menara sedang kacau.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.20,0:07:01.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula, apa kau bisa berubah\Njadi kalajengking besar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Agak beda dari yang dimaksud,\Ntapi aku memang bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku tak begitu menyukainya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.25,0:07:17.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ditatap dengan mata serius begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.65,0:07:22.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku yang sudah menunggu empat ratus tahun\Njadi tak bisa menahannya lagi, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf kalau aku kebanyakan bertanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.18,0:07:28.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dari yang kudengar,\Nujian di sini punya beberapa aturan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.93,0:07:32.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pas bergairah begini malah tanya soal itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, memang ada, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beri tahu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eng...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.65,0:07:40.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu, dilarang pergi\Ntanpa menyelesaikan ujian.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.15,0:07:43.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua, dilarang melanggar aturan ujian.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.69,0:07:46.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tiga, dilarang tidak sopan\Nterhadap perpustakaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.57,0:07:50.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Empat, dilarang melakukan perusakan\Nterhadap menara.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.25,0:07:52.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang kelima?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master tidak dengar, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma tahu sampai empat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak boleh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.38,0:08:06.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak boleh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.55,0:08:10.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak boleh!\NAku tidak mau membicarakannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aturan yang kelima?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.48,0:08:14.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.39,0:08:17.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sama sekali tak ada hubungannya\Ndengan kemesraan kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin tak ada hubungannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.43,0:08:23.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa bersikap\Nsemuanya baik-baik saja tanpa tahu aturannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.90,0:08:25.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.98,0:08:26.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.33,0:08:29.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau penjaga bintang menara, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah melakukannya\Nselama empat ratus tahun, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.95,0:08:32.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.65,0:08:34.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru empat hari.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.91,0:08:35.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.53,0:08:39.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru juga empat hari...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,sejak Master dan lainnya\Ndatang ke menara ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma empat hari.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua hari di antaranya\NMaster terbaring pingsan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.97,0:08:50.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi waktuku bersama Master, mengobrol,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan bermesraan cuma dua hari.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.10,0:08:57.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah menunggu empat ratus tahun,\Ntapi cuma dibalas dua hari.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.08,0:09:01.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awalnya, aku berpikir\Nsepintas saja sudah cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama empat ratus tahun ini,\Naku terus menunggu Master di menara ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.38,0:09:12.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pikir hanya dengan sekilas saja\Nsudah membuatku puas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, ternyata tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.45,0:09:22.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master adalah segalanya bagiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.65,0:09:26.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seluruh diriku terbentuk\Ndari perasaanku pada Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.03,0:09:33.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan waktu empat ratus tahun pun\Ntakkan cukup menyampaikan perasaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan itu berakhir hanya dalam dua hari?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.02,0:09:43.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi karena itu kau tak mau\Nmemberitahuku aturan yang kelima?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya, kalau aku memberi tahu aturannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.73,0:09:49.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master pasti langsung tahu\Ncara menyelesaikan ujiannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau memberi tahu aturan ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku beri tahu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.23,0:09:56.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktuku bersama Master akan berakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.30,0:10:02.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah Master membenciku yang berbohong ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.73,0:10:07.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah Master benci\Nhingga tak ingin melihatku lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.40,0:10:11.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin aku bisa membencimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak, tidak. Master...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master! Master! Master! Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.48,0:10:24.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.19,0:10:28.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang melanggar aturannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master, sekarang masih ada waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih ada waktu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.88,0:10:39.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sekarang Master memberiku perintah,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.18,0:10:42.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku... aku bisa membunuh diriku sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.54,0:10:45.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku berubah bentuk,\Nsemuanya akan terlambat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.30,0:10:48.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku... sangat menginginkan Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat amat menginginkan Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, aku mohon...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.68,0:10:56.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perintahkan aku untuk mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begitu,\Naku tidak akan membunuh Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beri tahu aku aturan yang kelima.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master, ini bukan saatnya bahas itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau beri tahu...!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.94,0:11:08.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau beri tahu,\Naku akan memberimu perintah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.45,0:11:11.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja,\Nsebelum kau berubah menjadi monster,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan memberikanmu perintah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master memang penggoda wanita.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak merasa begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.50,0:11:22.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, Master adalah penggoda Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.00,0:11:27.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lima, menghancurkan ujian tidak dilarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.05,0:11:31.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuh, 'kan, tatapanmu langsung berubah?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menjadi Master yang kusukai.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum aku... bukan menjadi diriku lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.35,0:11:48.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, yang aku ucapkan tadi itu bohong.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master! Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.43,0:12:06.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa menyelamatkanmu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena Shaula akan menangis,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi aku takkan membiarkanmu membunuhku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.20,0:12:36.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pasti akan menyelamatkanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.25,0:12:47.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau mengingat Beti?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.73,0:12:49.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak pintar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.65,0:12:54.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru bangun?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan ke nol.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.98,0:13:01.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari sini,\Nkita akan memulai serangan balasan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.03,0:13:06.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Situasinya mungkin akan sedikit kacau.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pinjamkan aku kekuatanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.13,0:13:11.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja akan Beti lakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena Beti adalah partnermu, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.10,0:13:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah, apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.20,0:13:20.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kupikir siapa yang naik.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.93,0:13:21.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekalipun aku bergerak\Nsecepat mungkin dari titik ulang,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tetap tak bisa mencegah mereka bertemu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roy Alphard sang Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.96,0:13:35.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin kau membebaskannya, Reid Astrea.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.17,0:13:37.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hasilnya sudah terlihat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak seharusnya\Nmempermalukan lawan yang sudah kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.20,0:13:44.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, mau sampai kapan kau tidur?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat bangun!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi kau bilang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.15,0:13:53.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau memakanku atau apalah itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.10,0:13:55.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kubiarkan kau melakukannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.15,0:14:05.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal tadi tidak mau sampai\Nmenghajar kami habis-habisan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berubah pikiran.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah kau akan hidup atau mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.33,0:14:16.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reid Astrea.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.20,0:14:23.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.33,0:14:27.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya bermacam-macam.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.45,0:14:31.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah membayangkan banyak,\Nbanyak, banyak sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.06,0:14:34.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata melebihi bayanganku!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tu-Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.65,0:14:42.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aneh, ini aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.50,0:14:48.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang seperti ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.05,0:14:52.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang bocah yang aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makan atau dimakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.92,0:15:05.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah yang dinamakan hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.03,0:15:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tubuh fisik asli memang berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terasa sekali darah mengalir di daging ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.97,0:15:15.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memanfaatkan Otoritas sang Rakus\Nuntuk menimpa lawan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu mengambil alih kesadarannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.90,0:15:19.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.05,0:15:22.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sok bicara sesuatu yang rumit.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ikan teri macam kau terlalu banyak mengoceh.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sangat menjijikkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lawanmu adalah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melawanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.83,0:15:39.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pikir bisa melawanku
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.15,0:15:42.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,sambil melindungi tuan putri di belakangmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.43,0:15:57.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.48,0:15:58.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pikir bisa mengalahkanku seperti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.25,0:16:11.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang jadi hitungan pertama.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungan Reid dan Rakus\Ntidak bisa dihentikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.73,0:16:23.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mencegah Reid mengambil alih Rakus pun sulit.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Julius mungkin ada peluang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi Natsuki Subaru sama sekali\Ntak punya harapan menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bentuk erat lalu jatuhkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lumayan, lumayan juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.73,0:16:45.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena lumayan inilah,\Nkami makan dengan rakus!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.28,0:16:46.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau punya waktu untuk tertawa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,El Minya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.90,0:16:58.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.23,0:16:59.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.13,0:17:09.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami juga kerepotan menerima\Nserangan tadi terus menerus.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.09,0:17:09.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.85,0:17:14.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Abang boleh juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.89,0:17:18.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Abang bakal lanjut lagi ke berikutnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mati, bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.48,0:17:21.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan kedua.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bekerja sama dengan Emilia dan Ram,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.23,0:17:27.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk mengakhiri Rye Batenkaitos\Nsecepatnya telah gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.13,0:17:31.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serangan kejutan Beatrice\Ntidak efektif melawan Rakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dadah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.03,0:17:41.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tinggal satu langkah lagi, sedikit lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.60,0:17:44.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang membuat Rem seperti itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.05,0:17:44.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ram.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.40,0:17:48.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah dengan ini\Nkita berhasil menyingkirkan Rye?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, tidak bisa dibiarkan begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.95,0:17:52.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kita berpisah...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang namanya situasi itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.14,0:17:58.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,tinggal langsung bergerak\Ntanpa perlu memikirkan lawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.26,0:17:59.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.52,0:18:00.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan ketujuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.98,0:18:06.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si Rakus akan kabur jika situasinya\Ntidak akan menguntungkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.55,0:18:10.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu Reid yang dibiarkan begitu saja,\Npasti akan datang,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk membunuh Natsuki Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.45,0:18:21.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berjuanglah, cacing pasir!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.25,0:18:22.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan kesepuluh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melarikan diri ke luar menara bersama Meili.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Efektif memancing para binatang iblis.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.33,0:18:32.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang diincar binatang iblis\Nadalah Natsuki Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalajengking itu juga mungkin mengincarku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.75,0:18:37.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shaula.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki Subaru seorang diri
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,takkan bisa melindungi Meili.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan kesebelas.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan kedua belas.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hitungan kelima belas.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.38,0:19:07.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku takkan lagi membiarkan\Nsiapa pun mati sebelum diriku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.80,0:19:10.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.20,0:19:13.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, sadarlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beatrice?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, ini Beti.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.03,0:19:22.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, apa kau ingat...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih ingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau adalah Beatrice,\Naku adalah Natsuki Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.63,0:19:28.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita adalah partner yang sangat dekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.56,0:19:31.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bersama akan lanjut, tanpa merengut,\Npokoknya very good.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.48,0:19:34.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ve-Very good.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.10,0:19:36.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang dulu, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ceritakan lebih jelas apa yang terjadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana dengan Emilia dan lainnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.16,0:19:45.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingatlah baik-baik semua hal berharga itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.46,0:19:46.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingatlah semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru, kau diamlah di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.05,0:19:56.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar Beti yang menggantikanmu mengurusnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.51,0:19:58.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Jangan bercanda!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak apa-apa...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau gemetaran, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.68,0:20:09.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah berjuang terlalu keras, Subaru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.30,0:20:12.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, tunggu! Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.43,0:20:15.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau cuma begini, aku masih...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.73,0:20:18.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kami yang menutupi kekurangannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.78,0:20:21.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitulah cara Natsuki Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.65,0:20:32.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gara-gara aku lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru begini sudah menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak mungkin gemetaran seperti ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada sesuatu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.26,0:20:44.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuatu itulah\Nyang mengubahmu, 'kan, Natsuki Subaru?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.35,0:20:49.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau di dalamku memang ada dirimu\Nyang sebenarnya, keluarlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku... Aku sendiri tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku membutuhkanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.23,0:20:57.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki Subaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.23,0:21:02.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah sekarang kau sangat dibutuhkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.13,0:21:05.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kenapa malah aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang pengecut dan penakut ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.75,0:21:09.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak akan bisa...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.91,0:21:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.42,0:21:17.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa menyelamatkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.45,0:22:04.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuki
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.83,0:22:13.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Subaru.
